; Bob leaks after Alice pays, and the trace goes on. The answers for the whole
; trace say that it is not a violated trace of the sequence; the violation on a
; prefix says that its prefix up to the leak, entry 2, is, and that violation
; is final and takes precedence over DONE (formal/core/CORE.md, decision 34).
(scenario sequence_violation_not_last
  (spec "examples/core/core_sequence.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T09:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T10:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T11:00:00Z" (act bob leak must_not)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z" (tick)
    (data)))
